<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-FREE STATE 2ND INNS 69-0 V INDIA - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-FREE STATE 2ND INNS 69-0 V INDIA - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN, South Africa 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Free State, 24 ahead of India on first innings, were 69-0 in their second innings at the close on the second day of their three-day match at Springbok Park on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Free State 320-7 declared and 69-0, India 296-6 declared.</p>
